Bundled fonts
-------------

The web app bundles Latin and Latin-extended subsets of Google Sans, Roboto and
Roboto Mono (variable fonts), plus Lobster Two (wordmark), all licensed under the
SIL Open Font License 1.1. The files come from Fontsource
(https://fontsource.org), which repackages the upstream Google Fonts releases.
The license texts are in src/assets/fonts/LICENSE-*.txt.

The web app also bundles the Material Symbols Outlined icon font (Google, Apache License 2.0;
https://github.com/google/material-design-icons). Its license text is in
src/assets/fonts/LICENSE-material-symbols.txt.

The Android app bundles Latin and Latin-extended subsets of Google Sans and
Roboto (variable fonts from https://github.com/google/fonts), licensed under the
SIL Open Font License 1.1. The license texts are in
android-native/app/src/main/assets/licenses/.
